            "Rama pursued the deer for a long time, but it kept slipping further away each time. At last Rama struck it with his arrow. As it died, Maricha, mimicking Rama's voice, cried out loudly, 'O Sita! O Lakshmana!' so as to deceive Sita and Lakshmana.",
